TITLE Ca solution equilibration at 100C with calcite gypsum aragonite and gas phase at 25C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
    Aragonite 0 0
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g) 1
    CH4(g) 5
    H2S(g) 10
END
PRINT
    -species true
END
